---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { me } from '../data.js';

const title = 'Ahmet Emin Tayfur';
const description =
  'Statistics graduate in Istanbul working toward product management. Currently building GrammarLens, an English grammar app for iOS.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="row">
    <aside class="note">
      <strong>Index</strong>
      Istanbul<br />
      BSc Statistics, Ege Üniversitesi<br />
      June 2026
    </aside>
    <div class="body">
      <h1 class="display">Ahmet Emin Tayfur</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I studied statistics and I build products. Right now that means GrammarLens — an English
        grammar app for iOS that I researched, specced, and wrote myself. I'm looking for a product
        management role.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is the short version. It's here to show how I work rather than list everything
        I've done.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row">
    <aside class="note">
      <strong>Now</strong>
      4 user interviews<br />
      2 iteration rounds<br />
      Not yet released
    </aside>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Building GrammarLens</h2>
      <p>
        GrammarLens explains why an English sentence is wrong instead of just marking it wrong. It's
        built in Flutter and calls a language model to generate the explanation in context.
      </p>
      <p>
        I did the user research, wrote the PRD, built the app, tested it with four people, and made
        two rounds of changes based on what they said. It isn't in the App Store yet.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/products/grammarlens">See the product</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="/products/grammarlens/case-study">Read how it was built</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row">
    <aside class="note">
      <strong>How I work</strong>
      Three things that are<br />
      true about me, with<br />
      the evidence attached
    </aside>
    <div class="body">
      <h3>I state the real number</h3>
      <p>
        I tested GrammarLens with four people, not forty. Four was what I could actually get, and it
        was enough to cut two features I was attached to. I'd rather tell you the real sample size
        than round it into something that sounds better.
      </p>

      <h3>I build to find out what I'm wrong about</h3>
      <p>
        I taught myself Flutter because I wanted to know whether my idea survived contact with a
        real screen. Writing the spec was the easy part. Shipping it is where I found out that my
        assumption about how people would use it was wrong.
      </p>

      <h3>I treat cost as a product constraint</h3>
      <p>
        GrammarLens calls a model on every check, and every call costs money. So I batched
        evaluations and let users choose question length. That's not a technical detail — it's the
        difference between a product I can run and one I can't.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row">
    <aside class="note">
      <strong>Background</strong>
      Full history is on<br />
      LinkedIn. This is the<br />
      compressed version.
    </aside>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="entry">
        <span class="entry-role">Junior Business Development Specialist</span>
        <span class="entry-when">1 year</span>
        <span class="entry-org">
          Auratech Consultancy — B2B sales funnel, HubSpot, data collection and cleaning
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <span class="entry-role">SAP Consulting Intern</span>
        <span class="entry-when">Internship</span>
        <span class="entry-org">GOERZ-IT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <span class="entry-role">Data Analyst Intern</span>
        <span class="entry-when">Internship</span>
        <span class="entry-org">Konak İlçe Milli Eğitim Müdürlüğü</span>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <span class="entry-role">BSc Statistics</span>
        <span class="entry-when">June 2026</span>
        <span class="entry-org">Ege Üniversitesi</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px">
        Tools I use regularly: Flutter and Dart, SQL, Power BI, Excel, statistical modelling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row">
    <aside class="note">
      <strong>Contact</strong>
      Happy to talk about<br />
      product roles or the<br />
      app itself
    </aside>
    <div class="body">
      <ul class="links">
        <li>
          <span class="links-label">Email</span>
          <a href={`mailto:${me.email}`}>{me.email}</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="links-label">LinkedIn</span>
          <a href={me.linkedin}>Full work history</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="links-label">GitHub</span>
          <a href={me.github}>svactrion</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
